Progress package

Tool description, schema, validation and display metadata are adapted from
Sailry ef5e82ea, plugins/builtin/progress/agent/mod.rs,
plugins/builtin/progress/desktop/messages.rs and desktop/activity/{board,cards,projects}.rs.
The desktop office scene uses the public activity catalog, shared Client lanes,
Kit controls, and the shared native conversation and modal components.

The transparent office atlas was generated for this package with OpenAI ImageGen.
Its soft miniature art direction follows the committed City Trader package at
6b09490695ae4d592ba3e4b8ee1b1eef73fd33f0; no City Trader artwork is copied.

The core records authoritative tool history and reduces task progress.
Session activity, navigation and notifications remain core capabilities.
